       "q": "为什么场强里没有 d？",
       "a": "在忽略边缘效应、板间为均匀线性介质的平行板模型中，$E=\\sigma_0/(\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon_r)$。"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 3,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 540,
     "w": 770,
     "h": 130,
     "tex": "U=Ed=\\\\dfrac{\\\\sigma_0 d}{\\\\varepsilon_0\\\\varepsilon_r}",
     "size": 32,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center",
     "hotspot": true,
     "label": "电势差与场强关系",
     "qa": [
      {
       "q": "U 为什么等于 E 乘 d？",
       "a": "板间是匀强电场，电势差等于场强沿距离的积分，故 $U=Ed=\\sigma_0 d/(\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon_r)$。"
      }
